            {"label": "Evaluation evidence", "value": "Trust ARA 2023-24 disclosure; CQC inspection (RXG); South Yorkshire ICS estate strategy"},
            {"label": "Predecessor / successor", "value": "Predecessor: pre-2022 IAS 17 operating-lease expense · Successor: NHSPS market-rent reform + Sheffield place-based integration"}
